@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-access-token

### Rolling-hour metric and 24 rolling hourly buckets, scoped to the signed-in user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/scoring-throughput
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Anonymous requests are rejected (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/scoring-throughput
Accept: application/json
